CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/f/an com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/gui/UnitResourceLagHiding
	COMMENT UnitResourceLagHiding - client side prediction of a unit's ammo/energy/custom resources so the HUD does not jump when the authoritative update arrives. Static: fakeResources (a, FastArrayList of UnitResourceLagHidingFakeUnitResources) and placeholderUnit (b, a PlaceholderUnit reused for read-only checks). a(Unit) looks the entry up by unit id (or creates one seeded with Unit.ammo/energy and NetworkEngine.X as the tick), then the price arithmetic is applied locally; c(Unit,CustomPrice) and a(LogicBoolean,OrderableUnit) temporarily swap the fake values onto the placeholder/real unit, evaluate, and restore. Entries older than 80 ticks (or belonging to the unit an action was just issued to) are dropped. Only active when NetworkEngine.B is set. NOTE: this class is the reason Unit.ammo/Unit.energy were identified. [field names + behaviour verified from code]
	FIELD a fakeResources Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/utility/m;
	FIELD b placeholderUnit Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/f/x;
	METHOD a clearFakeResources ()V
	METHOD a getFakeResources (J)Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/f/ao;
	METHOD a getOrCreateFakeResources (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/f/ao;
	METHOD a addFakeResources (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/d/b;)V
	METHOD a readLogicBoolean (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/logicBooleans/LogicBoolean;Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/y;)Z
	METHOD a removeFakeResources (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/y;Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/a/s;)V
	METHOD b subtractFakeResources (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/d/b;)V
	METHOD c canAfford (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/d/b;)Z
